{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.X5BringWeightIdentification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.X5BringWeightIdentification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Circle"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5BringWeight.bring_weight_match","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5BringWeight.bring_weight_match","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-bring-weight-identification.lean#L43-L65","doc":"**Bring / X_5 weight match**: ζ₅⁴ = ζ₅⁻¹.\n\nExpresses that the Z_5-eigenvalue of the first Lagrange resolvent\nw_1 on Bring (computed as ζ₅^{-1} via the DFT action\nσ(w_k) = ζ₅^{-k} w_k) coincides with the Z_5-eigenvalue of the\nX_5 coordinate x under the automorphism (x, y) ↦ (ζ₅·x, y).\n\nProof: from `zeta5^5 = 1` and `zeta5 ≠ 0` (Complex.exp never\nvanishes), `zeta5^4 = zeta5^5 / zeta5 = 1 / zeta5 = zeta5⁻¹`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:x5-bring-weight-identification}`\nRef: [edge1978] https://doi.org/10.1112/jlms/s2-18.3.539 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5BringWeight.zeta5_pow_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5BringWeight.zeta5_pow_five","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-bring-weight-identification.lean#L31-L41","doc":"ζ₅^5 = 1 — `(exp(2πi/5))^5 = exp(2πi) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.X5BringWeight.zeta5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.X5BringWeight.zeta5","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-bring-weight-identification.lean#L26-L29","doc":"Primitive fifth root of unity (local copy). ","signatureChunk":0}]}